    &= \frac{3}{2} + \frac{1}{2}\sum_{\text{cyc}}\frac{yz}{x^2},
\end{align*}
and    $$ \sum_{\text{cyc}}\frac{yz}{x^2} = \sum_{\text{cyc}} \frac{(b+c)(c+a)}{(a+b)^2} \ge 3 \sqrt[3]{\prod_{\text{cyc}}\frac{(b+c)(c+a)}{(a+b)^2}} = 3, $$  from the AM-GM Inequality.

