And doing the same for  $n = 3$  to  $n = 4$  and adding it to the right and bottom for variety:
[asy]usepackage("tikz");label("\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.8]
\foreach \i in {0,1,2,3} \draw[blue,thick] (0,\i)--(3,\i); \foreach \i in {0,1,2,3} \draw[blue,thick] (\i,0)--(\i,3);
\node at (1.5,0.5) { $1$ }; \node at (2.5,0.5) { $1$ }; \node at (2.5,1.5) { $1$ }; 
\node at (0,-0.5) {};
\end{tikzpicture}
\begin{tikzpicture}
\node at (0,0) {}; \node at (0,1.5) { $\quad \Rightarrow \quad$ };
