Note that, by Weighted AM-GM,
\begin{align*}
\left(1+a_n\right)^n = \left(\dfrac{1}{n - 1} + \dfrac{1}{n - 1} + \cdots + \dfrac{1}{n - 1} + a_n\right)^n \geq \left(\dfrac{n^n}{(n-1)^{n - 1}}\right) \cdot a_n.
\end{align*}
Therefore,
\begin{align*}
