By AM-GM, we know that \[\dfrac{k-1\left(\dfrac{1}{k-1}\right)+a_k}{k} \ge \sqrt[k]{\dfrac{a_k}{(k-1)^{k-1}}}.\] Now, we can multiply both sides by  $k$  and take it to the power of  $k$  to get that \[(1+a_k)^k \ge \dfrac{k^ka_k}{(k-1)^{k-1}}.\] Taking the product of this inequality from  $k=2$  to  $n$  gives:
