\end{align*}
Therefore  $AF\parallel MK$  and  $\triangle BKM\sim \triangle BAS\Longrightarrow BA=BS$ . So
\begin{align*}
SM=AB+BM=c+s-c=s
\end{align*}
Similarly  $TM=s$  and we are done.

