	\end{align*}Hence,
\begin{align*}
		\angle IKI_2 &= 180^\circ - \angle BIP - \angle II_2I_1 
		&= 90^\circ. 
	\end{align*}
Thus,  $\overline{CI} \perp \overline{I_1I_2}$ , and  $\overline{CI} \perp \overline{O_1O_2}$ , which implies  $\overline{I_1I_2} \parallel \overline{O_1O_2}$ . This completes the proof.

